DATA AND CONTENT LICENSES

The code in this repository is MIT licensed. The language data is derived
from separate upstream sources under their own licenses:

  * Example sentences  -- Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), CC BY 2.0 FR.
    Sentence authors are credited in data/attribution.json.
  * Noun genders/plurals -- german-nouns (gambolputty), CC BY-SA 4.0,
    compiled from German Wiktionary.
  * Word frequency list -- FrequencyWords (hermitdave), MIT, derived from
    the OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus.
  * Curated word lists and grammar points under content/ -- original work,
    MIT (same as the code).

Because the repository redistributes CC BY-SA 4.0 material (noun data),
the combined data files are distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
